<title>CANADA: MOTOR RACING-ANDRETTI WINS IN VANCOUVER INDYCAR RACE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-ANDRETTI WINS IN VANCOUVER INDYCAR RACE.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael Andretti won the Vancouver IndyCar Grand Prix in a Lola Ford on Sunday.</p>
<p>Bobby Rahal finished second in a Reynard Mercedes-Benz. Christian Fittipaldi finished third in a Lola Ford.</p>
</text>
